      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In a randomised, prospective, parallel, double-masked study we examine the surface anesthetic effect of Bupranolol 0.25% in an oily solution. Bupranolol 0.25% decreases the corneal sensitivity to 23 mg/S, with the maximum between the 6th and 15th minute after application."},
